    "linkedin:1f62397c4eeb6ccaab1e9407": {
      "job": {
        "title": "Full-stack Developer (Remote)",
        "company": "Zynvex Solutions",
        "location": "Islāmābād, Pakistan",
        "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4467388586",
        "platform": "Linkedin",
        "date_posted": "",
        "is_remote": true,
        "description": "**Company Description** \n Zynvex Solutions is a global technology company and software development community focused on innovation, collaboration, and digital transformation. The organization brings together developers, engineers, and technology professionals worldwide to design impactful solutions and support business growth in a rapidly evolving digital landscape. Zynvex specializes in advanced IT services and next\\-generation digital products, emphasizing scalability, security, and quality. Through a collaborative ecosystem, the company promotes knowledge sharing, mentorship, and training for both experienced professionals and aspiring developers. Team members join an international network committed to continuous learning and building solutions that shape the future of the digital world.\n   \n\n**Role Description** \n The Full\\-stack Developer (Remote) is a full\\-time role responsible for designing, developing, and maintaining web applications across both front\\-end and back\\-end layers. Day\\-to\\-day activities include implementing user interfaces, building and optimizing APIs, integrating databases, and ensuring responsive, accessible, and performant web experiences. The role involves collaborating with cross\\-functional teams to gather requirements, define technical solutions, conduct code reviews, and maintain coding standards and best practices. The Full\\-stack Developer will troubleshoot and resolve technical issues, contribute to architecture decisions, and participate in testing and deployment processes. This remote position requires proactive communication, effective time management, and a strong focus on delivering robust, secure, and scalable solutions.\n   \n\n**Qualifications**\n  \n\n* Candidates should possess strong Full\\-Stack Development and Software Development skills, with experience building complete web applications.\n* Candidates should possess solid Front\\-End Development skills, including proficiency with HTML, JavaScript, and Cascading Style Sheets (CSS).\n* Candidates should possess Back\\-End Web Development skills, including experience with server\\-side frameworks, APIs, databases, and application security practices.\n* Experience with modern front\\-end frameworks (e.g., React, Vue, or Angular) and back\\-end technologies (e.g., Node.js, .NET, Java, or Python) is beneficial.\n* Knowledge of version control systems (e.g., Git), CI/CD pipelines, and cloud platforms (e.g., AWS, Azure, or GCP) is preferred.\n* Strong problem\\-solving abilities, clean coding habits, and familiarity with agile or iterative development methodologies are advantageous.\n* Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience is beneficial.\n* Effective communication skills, ability to work independently in a remote setting, and commitment to continuous learning and collaboration are important.",
